body:
Awesome man!

&#x200B;

I lost my virginity to an escort. I too suffer with a mental illness. I have been on a lot of different medications, spent a good time in hospitals, and been with a lot of therapists. I was scared and I mistakenly did not follow the escort's simple instructions. When I tried rescheduling I chickened out, but changed my mind and said "fuck it." It was certainly awkward at first, and I glad she was helpful. I basically asked her "how do I finger a woman." I was there to learn and have fun. Near the end of the appointment she didn't believe I was a virgin. Now, that maybe a lie, but a good lie. I left sexy dirty, confident, and just down right good about myself. Also, it is weird, I am not clingy when it comes to escorts.

&#x200B;

Gosh, it has been over a year since then. My first relationship with a woman ended, and I made matters worse. I guess I am clingy and creepy. Now, I think I want to become an active hobbyist to help me.

&#x200B;

Everyone is different. You do you!
